Vaxison is a hard fork of caelestia-shell by the Caelestia contributors,
forked at commit f80a98079b19f91f7d8a24218d068e77acc00025
(https://github.com/caelestia-dots/shell).

Upstream is not tracked after the fork. Original copyright notices are kept,
and Vaxison is distributed under the same license (GPL-3.0, see LICENSE).

The colour schemes catppuccin, gruvbox, rosepine, everforest, tokyonight, nord, dracula, onedark and
solarized in data/schemes/ were copied from the data of caelestia-cli by the Caelestia contributors
(https://github.com/caelestia-dots/cli, GPL-3.0).
